    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You radiate malignant power associated with one of the Dead Three. At the start of each of your turns, each creature of your choice within a 10-foot Emanation originating from you takes damage equal to your Intelligence modifier (minimum of 1); the damage type is the same as the damage Resistance granted by your choice in the Dread Allegiance feature.</p><p>Damage dealt by this aura ignores Resistance. The aura is inactive while you have the Incapacitated condition.</p>",
